<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        /* Styles de base pour la compatibilité mail */
        body { 
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            color: #222222; 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding-bottom: 40px; }
        .main { 
            background-color: #ffffff; 
            max-width: 600px; 
            margin: 0 auto; 
            border: 1px solid #dddddd;
        }
        .header { 
            background-color: #000000; 
            color: #D4AF37; 
            padding: 30px; 
            text-align: center; 
        }
        .header h1 { 
            margin: 0; 
            text-transform: uppercase; 
            letter-spacing: 4px; 
            font-style: italic; 
            font-weight: 900;
        }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .order-id { 
            font-weight: bold; 
            color: #D4AF37; 
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
        .table th { 
            text-align: left; 
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000; 
            padding: 10px; 
            text-transform: uppercase; 
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .table td { padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee; }
        .total-section { margin-top: 20px; text-align: right; }
        .total-row { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; }
        .footer { 
            text-align: center; 
            padding: 20px; 
            font-size: 12px; 
            color: #888888; 
        }
        .btn-alpha {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background-color: #000;
            color: #D4AF37 !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="main">
            <div class="header">
                <h1>ALPHA <span style="color: #ffffff;">SYSTEM</span></h1>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
                <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Confirmation de Protocole</h2>
                <p>Bonjour <strong>{{ order.firstName }} {{ order.lastName }}</strong>,</p>
                <p>Votre commande <span class="order-id">#{{ order.id }}</span> a été enregistrée avec succès dans nos systèmes.</p>
                
                <p><strong>Récapitulatif de votre acquisition :</strong></p>
                
                <table class="table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Produit</th>
                            <th style="text-align: center;">Qté</th>
                            <th style="text-align: right;">Total</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% for item in order.orderProducts %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{ item.product.name }}</td>
                            <td style="text-align: center;">{{ item.qte }}</td>
                            <td style="text-align: right;">{{ (item.product.price * item.qte)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <div class="total-section">
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Frais de livraison : {{ order.city.shippingCost|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</p>
                    <p class="total-row">TOTAL TTC : <span style="color: #D4AF37;">{{ order.totalPrice|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</span></p>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px dashed #ccc; padding-top: 20px;">
                    <p><strong>Adresse de livraison :</strong><br>
                    {{ order.address }}<br>
                    {{ order.city.name }}</p>
                    
                    <p><strong>Méthode de paiement :</strong><br>
                    Paiement à la livraison</p>
                </div>

                <div style="text-align: center;">
                    <a href="{{ url('app_order_message', {id: order.id}) }}" class="btn-alpha">Suivre ma commande</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Alpha System - Protocole Commando.<br>
                Ceci est un message automatique, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>